 **Queue access:** employees operate only queues with a `queue_access` grant row (`permissions` JSON, MVP vocabulary `call` only via `App\Enums\QueuePermission`). Grants are managed by `App\Actions\SetQueueAccess` (owner/admin only, target membership and queue must share the entity, empty list revokes, audited to the `audit` channel). Owner/admin call without a grant row; non-members are denied everywhere. Authorization lives in `App\Policies\QueuePolicy` (`create`/`update`/`manageAccess`/`call`) and is enforced server-side inside the domain actions, not only at future HTTP/Livewire callers.
 
